# Timeline

When a change alters behavior, setup, or project files, append a dated entry to `timeline.md` in the same work. Oldest entries stay at the top. New entries go at the bottom.

Say what changed and the date. Do not invent behavior the change does not have.

A comment-only wording tweak does not need an entry.

```markdown
## 2026-11-08 — Short name

One or two sentences about what the player, the level, or the setup now does.
```
